: Take middle crossing, hold it, cipher all mail, act on enemy mail. F2 (s-mid) is the middle ford. Enemy presence at s-mid is high (Kite/Tiger). I will move my forces to F2 to secure the middle crossing. I will cipher all my outgoing orders."},{"seq":553,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c135","house":"orchid","letter":"L162","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":554,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c136","house":"orchid","letter":"L163","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-2","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"RMOKJS AKKT, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":555,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c137","house":"orchid","letter":"L164","kind":"order","to":"orchid-arch-1","path":["orchid-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2400,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":"LKWIMJ, IBQOD TK RKUTD LBJG IESSHM."},{"seq":556,"t":2100,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1651,"retries":0},{"seq":557,"t":2100,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"My doctrine is to take the middle crossing (F2) in the first five watches. Since I'm at watch 8, I need to consolidate. My units are at TIGER CAMP (Cav/Ele) and DHARA VILLAGE (Inf/Arch). I should push towards F2. I will use a decoy to draw attention while moving towards F2."},{"seq":558,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c138","house":"tiger","letter":"L165","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-1","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{"seq":559,"t":2100,"type":"courier","id":"c139","house":"tiger","letter":"L166","kind":"order","to":"tiger-inf-2","path":["tiger-camp","south-village","s-mid"],"depart":2100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK MIDDLE.","cipher":null},{